{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to your new job at Red Rock Market! Bag groceries, collect shopping carts, and perform daily tasks. Will you be an ideal employee or a slacker? Relax on your breaks with a variety of mini-games like rooftop golf, RC racing, and cart jousting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/description1.png?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/gif1.gif?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your coworkers have come up with fun ways to relax on their breaks. Grow your reputation and they'll invite you to join them. Invest the money you earn on the job in your new found passions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/description2.png?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/gif2.gif?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn performance points on the job and spend them on new abilities and upgrades. Learn to breakdance, drive a forklift, and more. Make yourself an invaluable member of the team, you might even win Employee of the Month!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/description3.png?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/gif3.gif?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone starts at the bottom, but perform well on the job and you'll be asked to help out in other departments like Produce, Deli, and Receiving. Better than collecting carts in the parking lot after dark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/description4.png?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/locals.gif?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fellow associates are an odd bunch, but they mean well. Chat with them on break, and you never know what you might learn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret mini-games to discover with multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill tree with lots of depth. Learn to breakdance, improve your golf swing, operate a forklift and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678260?t=1747969636","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/7182b1640a24bce027481b9e3e535593bc38ba09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747969636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/815249bb24d96dcec4cdaa60818055678862c814/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747969636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/815249bb24d96dcec4cdaa60818055678862c814/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747969636","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to your new job at Red Rock Market! Bag groceries, collect shopping carts, and perform daily tasks. Will you be an ideal employee or a slacker? Relax on your breaks with a variety of mini-games like rooftop golf, RC racing, and cart jousting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/description1.png?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/gif1.gif?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your coworkers have come up with fun ways to relax on their breaks. Grow your reputation and they'll invite you to join them. Invest the money you earn on the job in your new found passions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/description2.png?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/gif2.gif?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn performance points on the job and spend them on new abilities and upgrades. Learn to breakdance, drive a forklift, and more. Make yourself an invaluable member of the team, you might even win Employee of the Month!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/description3.png?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/gif3.gif?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone starts at the bottom, but perform well on the job and you'll be asked to help out in other departments like Produce, Deli, and Receiving. Better than collecting carts in the parking lot after dark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/description4.png?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/extras/locals.gif?t=1747969636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fellow associates are an odd bunch, but they mean well. Chat with them on break, and you never know what you might learn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret mini-games to discover with multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill tree with lots of depth. Learn to breakdance, improve your golf swing, operate a forklift and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["R2R Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678260/39086be65abd6af196e545654499763651c3731f/header.jpg?t=1747969636","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 R2R Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel x64 processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-capable Intel or